      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>registrySources contains configuration that determines how the container runtime should treat individual registries when accessing images for builds+pods. (e.g. whether or not to allow insecure access).  It does not contain configuration for the internal cluster registry.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
